From 498c6b67caddbf6ee4d23ff7f946d3eca87ca30c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Muse <muse@localhost>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 17:13:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] NV273: lam_moi_model cho claude-web, grok-web,
 openaicodex, muse2api

Lop loi: 4 module AI chua co lam_moi_model() trong khi loi va giao dien
da goi phuong thuc nay theo hop dong chung (app/lam_moi_model.py).
Grep cung lop: grep -rln lam_moi_model modules/*/module.py -> truoc 5,
sau 9; ls modules/*/manifest.json -> 43.
Theo nguyen tac, khong theo danh sach: loi chi goi lam_moi_model() neu
callable, khong nhac ten nha cung cap; moi module tu chua du logic cua
no, khong import cheo module khac, khong sua app/ hay web/.

Moi module them lam_moi_model() sau models() + khai model_tinh trong
manifest. TRUNG THUC: ca 4 deu KHONG co endpoint liet ke model hop le
cho dung loai xac thuc web cua chung trong repo (xem hoi-nv273-
endpoint-liet-ke.md), nen nguon la danh sach tinh khai trong manifest,
buoc 'lay lai' la kiem phien that cua module do; hong thi nem
RuntimeError mang ma xac_thuc/mang/sai_khuon va giu danh sach cu.
- claude-web: kiem qua GET /api/organizations (lay_org_id).
- grok-web: kiem qua /api/auth/session (lay_uid_tu_phien); thu thach
  truy cap khong vuot, bao mang va dung.
- openaicodex: lam moi token OAuth that qua _lam_moi_tai_khoan(ep=True).
- muse2api: kiem cookie that qua _kiem_cookie (auth/check + session).

Test: test/test_web2api_nv273_lam_moi_model.py, 21 test (5/module +
bang 9 module), qua dich vu gia cuc bo; toan bo test/ khong co do moi
so voi main sach (xem nv273-bao-cao.md).
